From: astrangedaytoday15-dev <342675337+astrangedaytoday15-dev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 07:04:37 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Bot Control B8: group steering bar

A Group bar in World 3D (followed unit = the owner's character or one of
its group's bots) and Instance Watch (owner's character in the
instance). Leader mode moves the owner's character, a self-bot, and the
group follows; Squad mode sends "stay" to the group bots and moves them
(the selected bot, or all on a small ring). Tools: Move (click the 3D
floor, or the flat map at the leader's height), Mark (click a mob: skull),
Mark nearest (like Tab: nearest live hostile mob to the leader from the
stream), Clear mark, Hold, Regroup. Commands to one bot are spaced a
second apart for the module's rate limit.

Backend: "bots:mark" -> "wowmin botmark <player> <icon> <entry>
<unitId>|clear", parsed WBOTMARK reply, logged with source "group"; the
allowlist mirror takes "moveto <x> <y> <z>".

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
